      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "羞咻咻♪",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 628,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7F9E54BB54BB266A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "含羞苞这种宝可梦啊，\n会忍耐严寒直到花苞绽放。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕİ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 640,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "542B7F9E82DE8FD979CD5B9D53EF68A6554AFF0C000A4F1A5FCD80104E255BD276F4523082B182DE7EFD653E300200100002011401300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我从你这位训练家身上\n感受到了能让含羞苞绽放的才能。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n你愿意来参加我们的品鉴会吗？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕİ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114ECE4F608FD94F4D8BAD7EC35BB68EAB4E0A000A611F53D752304E8680FD8BA9542B7F9E82DE7EFD653E7684624D80FD300200100001BE00000A4F60613F610F676553C252A062114EEC768454C192744F1A5417FF1F00100002011401300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "请来浦蓝8号街区的喷泉广场……\n我等着你哦。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕİ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 796,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BF767656D6684DD003853F78857533A768455B76CC95E7F573A20262026000A62117B4977404F6054E6300200100002011401300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 852,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "对于含羞苞来说，\n重要的是要长得健壮。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 864,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5BF94E8E542B7F9E82DE67658BF4FF0C000A91CD89817684662F8981957F5F97506558EE300200100002011401940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我想从含羞苞的表情和动作中\n发现它的艺术性。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƓ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 912,
