      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "202620265514300200100002011401300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "生机勃勃的色泽，\n鲜嫩欲滴的花苞！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƔ",
